<p>This disclaimer covers the Swarmnest directory of AI tools, APIs and data sources, the Agent Skills directory, our public API and machine-readable files. It is part of our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Sale and Use</a>.</p>

<h2>1. Third-Party Tools, Not Endorsed</h2>
<p>Tools, APIs, skills and companies in the directory are made by other people. A listing is not an endorsement, recommendation, certification, security review or partnership. Names and trademarks belong to their owners and are used only to identify the tools. Unless a listing is clearly labelled "Sponsored", we are not paid to list it (see <a href="/disclosure/">Sponsored &amp; Affiliate Disclosure</a>).</p>

<h2>2. Accuracy and Currency</h2>
<ul>
<li>Descriptions are short summaries written in our own words. Features, pricing, authentication, rate limits and terms change often, so a listing may be out of date or wrong.</li>
<li>Status, "Free" and "No Auth" labels, and link checks are partly automated and may be wrong.</li>
<li>Always check the vendor's own site, documentation, pricing and terms before you rely on a tool or send it data.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. No Warranty</h2>
<p>The directory and its data are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, to the fullest extent the law allows. We are not responsible for third-party sites, tools or APIs, for their content, availability, security, data handling or charges, or for anything that happens when you use them.</p>

<h2>4. Skills and Code From Others</h2>
<p>Listings of skills, rules and templates link to code or instructions written by others. They are labeled "Third-Party": we have not audited them. Read them before you install or run them. See the <a href="/digital-products-disclaimer/">Digital Products Disclaimer</a>.</p>

<h2>5. Corrections, Removal and Takedown</h2>
<p>If you own or represent a listed tool and want a correction or removal, or you have a copyright concern, email <a href="mailto:hello@swarmnest.ai?subject=Listing%20request">hello@swarmnest.ai</a> or follow <a href="/takedown/">Takedown &amp; Corrections</a>. We aim to reply within a few business days and will correct clear factual errors promptly. Copyright notices follow the process on that page and our <a href="/dmca/">DMCA</a> page.</p>
